TEXT 160 32 Left 3 ;Bluetooth headphones - stereo analog audio path
TEXT 160 80 Left 2 ;Simplified models only: BM83 DAC sources -> coupling -> amplifier -> resistive drivers
TEXT 160 112 Left 2 ;Educational approximation - see README.md for analysis instructions
TEXT 160 640 Left 2 !.include audio_models.lib
TEXT 160 680 Left 2 !.param VBAT=3.7 VBIAS=1.35 VSIG=50m FTEST=1k AVOL=1 RINPUT=37k
TEXT 160 720 Left 2 ;.ac dec 100 10 100k
TEXT 160 760 Left 2 ;Optional transient command (inactive): .tran 0 20m 0 1u
TEXT 160 816 Left 2 ;Bias 1.35 V and 50 mV signal are illustrative; 38 ohm loads approximate the drivers.
TEXT 160 848 Left 2 ;AVOL=1 is an ideal unity-gain setting; RINPUT=37k is a conservative input-resistance approximation.
TEXT 160 880 Left 2 ;Analysis scope: analog coupling-network response and ideal stereo voltage gain.
TEXT 160 912 Left 2 ;VBAT and supply bypassing identify the circuit supply reference.
TEXT 464 640 Left 2 !.tran 5
